AI-Suitable tend to be:
    • Assistance tasks (summary, draft, format) 
    • Pattern-finding in provided data 
    • Variation generation 
    • Low-stakes decisions (human reviews) 
AI-Risky tend to be:
    • Decisions with moderate consequences 
    • Tasks mixing facts + judgment 
    • Bias-sensitive contexts 
    • Tasks requiring current information 
AI-Incompatible tend to be:
    • High-stakes, high-accuracy required 
    • Legal/regulatory decisions 
    • Medical/safety decisions 
    • Tasks where "I don't know" isn't an option but AI lacks data 

